# DOC Source Format

`QuestionAsset.file_format='DOC'` is the high-fidelity format for question content authored in Microsoft Word — MathType OLE objects, embedded images, drawings, native tables, custom fonts. Single-slot only (one `.docx` per `(question × asset_type × language)`).

## End-to-end pipeline

```
  ┌── ingest (filename ext .doc/.docx) ─────────┐
  ├── admin upload (.docx, single-slot)         │── on disk in SOURCE_PATH
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                          │
                          ├──→ async thumbnail render (Word COM → PDF → PyMuPDF → PNG, cached on disk)
                          │      → dashboard cards / preview modal / viewer
                          │
                          └──→ generation: marker paragraph + post-save Selection.InsertFile
                                 → master.docx → (optional) ExportAsFixedFormat PDF
```

